        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 1:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 16:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erega ntiyamenye kw ari jewe namuha za ngano na vino n’amavuta, nkamusenyurirakw ifeza n’izahabu, ivyo bākoreshereje Bayali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOL.1.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yow 1:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gituma nzosubira ku ngano zanje mu gihe zokweze, no kuri vino yanje mu gihe yoganiwe, kandi nzomushikura bga bgoya bganje bg’intama n’ipampa yanje, vyari kumumara ubgambure bgiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LAM.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Int 1:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noneho ngira ngaragarize ibiteye isoni vyiwe imbere y’abūzure biwe, kandi nta n’umwe azomurokora ngw amunkūre mu maboko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 1:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.8.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Am 8:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzomucakw ibitwengo, n’imisi mikuru yaziririza, bo n’ imboneko z’amezi n’amasabato n’ imisi mikuru yose yashinzwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MIC.1.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mik 1:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nzoririka imizabibu yiwe n’imisukoni yiwe, ivyo yahora avuga, at’ Izi n’impēra zanje nahawe n’abūzure banje. Nukw ivyo ngira ndabihindure ishamba, vyōnwe n’ibikōko vyo mw ishamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.23.40"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 23:40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzomuhōra imisi yamaze yosereza za Bayali imibavu, yisakaye impeta n’utugenegene, agakurikira abūzure biwe, nanje jeho akanyibagira, ni k’Uhoraho agize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 40:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.20.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 20:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko rero, ehe ngira ndamukwēgēre, mmushikane mu bugaragwa, ndamuremeshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 2:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.11.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 11:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzohamukomōrera imizabibu yiwe, ndamuhe ca kiyaya c’i Akori ngo kimubere irembo ry’ivyizigiro: na we azoharirimbira, nko mu gihe c’ubuto bgiwe, nko mu gihe yadūga, avuye mu gihugu ca Egiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi kur’ uwo musi, ni k’Uhoraho agize, uzonyita umugabo wawe, ntuzoba ukinyita shobuja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
