        {
          "text": "Maze kur’ uwo musi nzosezerana isezerano n’ibikōko vyo mw ishamba, n’ibisīga vyo mu kirēre, n’ivyikwega hasi, kubganyu: kandi nzoca umuheto n’inkota n’intambara bibavire mu gihugu, ntume baryama amahoro. ",
